n2-skuld derives source-debt scanning, category freshness and archival concepts
from the MIT-licensed N2 Daebung Skuld module, copyright 2026 N2 AI Family.

The common Soul SQL schema derives from the MIT-licensed n2-mimir Rust core,
copyright 2026 N2 AI Family. The full MIT text is included in LICENSE.

Cargo.lock records exact external dependency versions. Cargo retrieves their
source packages and corresponding license files during a build. Principal
dependencies include rusqlite and libsqlite3-sys (MIT), SQLite (public domain),
Tree-sitter and its language grammars (MIT), clap (MIT OR Apache-2.0), serde
and serde_json (MIT OR Apache-2.0), regex (MIT OR Apache-2.0), chrono (MIT OR
Apache-2.0), uuid (Apache-2.0 OR MIT), fs2 (MIT OR Apache-2.0), and same-file
(Unlicense OR MIT). See each dependency's package license before redistributing
compiled binaries.
